/span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premise: After death, a soul must be sent to a better world - that's the law. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if the soul can't leave this world? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In such cases, soul guides can help, and you are one of them, or rather, you will soon become one. However, your first &quot;delivery&quot; doesn't go according to plan at all because the ancient evil no longer sleeps\u2026<br><br><br>What is this story about? An emotional journey about living as a raven who is constantly connected to death \u2014 sometimes it's strangers, and sometimes it's someone very close. But don\u2019t be misled; the world of VORON, inspired by Norse mythology, offers an unusual perspective on life and death. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And don\u2019t forget to caw and croak from time to time, you\u2019re raven after all</h2>","developers":["Merk Games"],"dlc":[4097020],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245180/2013a3cde9d0078450b0cbdb2399265cbc405e70/header.jpg?t=1761266260","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245180/208970349/d324913eb41ed7339cb6610af430ad4389111472/1758754642/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758757241","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245180/208970349/d324913eb41ed7339cb6610af430ad4389111472/1758754642/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758757241","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2245180/208970349/d324913eb41ed7339cb6610af430ad4389111472/1758754642/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758757241","id":257075611,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257075611/movie480.mp4?t=1758757241","max":"https://video.akamai.stea